  avoid:['Opening the window for a one-colour, one-size product: it adds from the card.','A size pre-selected when there is more than one (colour is pre-selected, PDP logic; size is the customer’s choice: “Please select a size”).','Hand-building it: DG_quickAdd.html(model, p, img, desk) — or the page-owned form DG_quickAdd.html(p, {desk}) + DG_quickAdd.wire(layer) (product carousel, Added to Bag).'],
  anatomy:['Window: DS .mdl, title “Quick Add” 20 strong + 16 close, gap 6 (24px) between blocks; desktop 480 wide (.mdl--qa), mobile .mdl--up (overlay fades, window slides up)','Beauty product row: 64 × 96 image (2:3) gap 4 (16px) → brand 16 strong / name 16 regular gap 1 (4px), price 16 (14 on mobile) 14 below','Fashion / Home: brand + name, then the price block: now + was + Save 20% (14) on one row, code line (14) under','Colour: .opt-label “Colour: name” gap 3 (12px) over the control — .cdd 50 tall (30 chip + name + 24 chevron; open list over the field, selected row on Grey 1 with a ringed chip, “Only n left in stock” 12 red per shade) or .cswatches (60 wide, 2:3)','Size: .sz buttons (struck through when out of stock) or the DS select · stock: .alert--text 16 red','ADD TO BAG (.bd pri) → .bd.spn → ✓ ADDED (.bd.done) → closes after 2s · VIEW PRODUCT (.bd sec) gap 2 (8px) under','Card button: Icon Only Button · Quick Add → pressed (scale .9) → .spin.sm → .qa-tick → default after 2s; the header bag count goes up (dg:quickadd)'],
