  summary:'One product line in the bag (Bag 2026). A 68 × 102 image, brand - name, variant, bag price, wishlist and the quantity stepper; every bag state and add-on is a part of the same card.',
  use:['The bag page (templates/bag.html) and anything that lists bag lines.','DG_bag.card(it) builds it; the page re-renders after DG_bag.act().'],
  avoid:['A wishlist on gift cards or memberships.','Copy over 2 lines of name + 1 of variant on mobile (4 shared lines on desktop) — it truncates.','Hand-building a bag line.'],
  anatomy:['1px --border-subtle, radius 4, gap 3 (12px) in; image 68 × 102 (2:3) → info gap 4 (16px); info gap 2 (8px); text 12 mobile / 14 desktop, brand strong','Right column: wishlist 16 · quantity stepper (delete at 1, + greys at max; delete only for out of stock / gift card / membership / customised) · spacer','Out of stock + quantity error: --text-error border and the error .msg on top; out of stock greys the copy','Add-ons under a hairline, gap 4 (16px): XCover Add (.bd.xs) → Purchase Protection Remove (.bd.xs.line) · Subscribe & Save (Subscribe | Save 5%) · Taskrabbit (Learn More) · Free Gift · Your Customisation · Pre-Order dispatch note (#F2F2F2 box) · Taggstar = .sp-bag.sp-bag--sm','Wishlist opens Move to your Wishlist? (DS alert modal); View Details opens e-Gift Card Details'],
